{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883870/extras/76c0439bfa355a3d404f67d26817ec6b.poster.avif?t=1754082932\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883870/extras/76c0439bfa355a3d404f67d26817ec6b.webm?t=1754082932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883870/extras/76c0439bfa355a3d404f67d26817ec6b.mp4?t=1754082932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a physics-based casual sandbox game, where there are no limits to your creativity. Mess around with liquids, explore the space, build machines, or just explode everything you can see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883870/extras/31f32e59bf19c0c12e78ce548811f07a.poster.avif?t=1754082932\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883870/extras/31f32e59bf19c0c12e78ce548811f07a.webm?t=1754082932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883870/extras/31f32e59bf19c0c12e78ce548811f07a.mp4?t=1754082932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can explore various zones, like surface, the caves and the terrain. Using various object, that will help you in your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883870/extras/c14f574e99dbac9957569052152ba872.poster.avif?t=1754082932\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883870/extras/c14f574e99dbac9957569052152ba872.webm?t=1754082932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883870/extras/c14f574e99dbac9957569052152ba872.mp4?t=1754082932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be creative however you like to be. Express your ideas through your buildings. Your imagination is literally your only limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883870/extras/406df57b1372bcafd63ec3e0ddf9293a.poster.avif?t=1754082932\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883870/extras/406df57b1372bcafd63ec3e0ddf9293a.webm?t=1754082932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883870/extras/406df57b1372bcafd63ec3e0ddf9293a.mp4?t=1754082932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can play around with these fun things:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blocks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">TNT</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Glue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Balloons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Water</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plasma</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sand</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And much more</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3883870?t=1754082932","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3883870?t=1754082932","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883870/26ee4733b0e9cd629cfb3bc9cf69da11dd8a6ef5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754082932","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883870/26ee4733b0e9c